					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The first image was provided to the wiki by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gene-r" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=634139&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1569351420" alt="Gene R" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=634139)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gene-r" >Gene R</a></span>.</p> <p>The second image could not be sourced. It is assumed to be not compliant with CC 3.0</p> <p>The last image is from <a href="https://geekologie.com/2012/04/not-during-lunch-animals-with-no-skin-mu.php">here</a>, whose ToS prevents redistribution of content.</p> <p>As such, both the second and third image have been removed</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-618540#post-2308253</guid>
				<title>STAFF POST: Addition - Attribution Notice.</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-618540/interlude-excerpt-from-an-auction-catalog-marshall-carter-an#post-2308253</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2015 00:39:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dexanote</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>481882</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>At Decibelle's suggestion we are adding a variant of the disclaimer used on <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-173">SCP-173</a>'s page detailing our relationship with images of the IRL sculpture.</p> <p>As stated in the article, SCP-173 is a secondary use of the image of the art piece &quot;Untitled 2004&quot;, which was created by Izumi Kato. The concept of SCP-173 does not have any relationship with the artist's original concept of &quot;Untitled 2004&quot;.</p> <p>The image used in this Tale was taken by wiki user Gene_R and borrowed from <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-76692/scp-173#post-1416546">this post.</a></p> <p><strong>Images of the &quot;Untitled 2004&quot; sculpture may be used for non-commercial purposes only.</strong></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-618540#post-2041676</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
