					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm honestly left feeling like this could have been so much more. Like, maybe 173 should've been friendly towards humans, implying that it was just trying to get out of containment when the Foundation had it, or maybe there should've been more of them. I dunno, it just seems kind of&#8230; dull.</p> 
				 	]]>
