					<![CDATA[
						 <p>they're not <em>giving</em> it away. They're <em>selling</em> it for a huge price.</p> <p>Is it hugely dangerous? Well, yes. That's why the price is so enormously huge.</p> <p>&quot;But,&quot; you say, &quot;it's UNBELIEVABLY DANGEROUS AND DIFFICULT TO CONTROL!&quot;</p> <p>&quot;Yes,&quot; says the MC&amp;D spokesperson, speaking very slowly and clearly, as if to a mildly retarded person: &quot;that is why it is so&#8230; EX-PEN-SIVE.&quot;</p> 
				 	]]>
